  "identityReviews": [
    "Exact in-line day/date/month window, baton markers, rose-gilt dial and platinum case match manufacturer 5236P-010. Earlier 5396 family hypothesis rejected: that model has separate day/month and date layouts.",
    "Manufacturer confirms 5270P-017 red lacquered black-gradient dial, platinum case and black composite strap with red stitching. Exact complications, hands and case match uploaded graphic.",
    "Manufacturer confirms 15500 generation with wide indexes, external printed minute track and outward date window. Those visible features distinguish this upload from the older15400 candidate; black steel full SKU03 established.",
    "Exact blue wave dial, titanium case, rose-gold bezel and black ceramic strap inserts match Prestige Time265-90-3c/93 original. Ceramic inserts distinguish the3c configuration from gold-insert3/93; display stand obscures rear strap in upload."
  ],
